  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/029H">Exercise <span data-tag="029H">111.35.5</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $x \in X$. Define addition of tangent vectors, using Exercise <a href="/tag/029G" data-tag="029G">111.35.4</a> and a suitable morphism </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K[\epsilon ]) \longrightarrow \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K[\epsilon _1, \epsilon _2]/(\epsilon _1\epsilon _2)).  \]
</div>
  <p> Similarly, define scalar multiplication of tangent vectors (this is easier). Show that $T_{X/S, x}$ becomes a $\kappa (x)$-vector space with your constructions. </p>
